From b35ea3a75076e64655bc2c975bca4b26a2f5f296 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 4laric <4laric@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 05:58:29 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] BigTreasure: lane-owned versioned persistence policy +
 fixture (#246)

Engine-free fixed-size record (magic + schema version + CRC-32) serializing
the audit's open persistence surfaces: 4 weapon attached flags + healths +
Louie, the FSM phase/chosen/pending/awaiting flags, the attack-pool ledger
(started/in-flight/elecMaxNodes) and an explicit dropped-weapon cargo ledger
with pop velocities so a restore neither re-captures a pellet nor duplicates
its reward. Fail-closed restore rejects wrong magic/version/size, truncation,
bad checksum, NaN/out-of-range values and invariant violations without partial
mutation; enforces 1 + maxDischarge <= 17, health in [0,6000] and in-flight
within capacity.

Lane proposal only: not wired into the game save path; submitted for lane
06/01 shared-save review. Adds one additive CMake TU line and a
serialization-only friend bridge; no hooks or runtime behavior change.
